cff-version: 1.2.0
message: >-
  If you use this repository, please cite the source manuscript it
  implements. This repository is an author reference implementation
  developed by Ali Akarma (co-author of the manuscript).
title: >-
  CivicWorkOS: Capability-Preserving Adaptive Task Allocation Among Humans,
  AI Agents, and Robots in Municipal Services (reference implementation and
  evaluation testbed)
type: software
version: 0.3.0
date-released: "2026-10-16"
license: MIT
keywords:
  - human-robot-AI task allocation
  - adaptive automation
  - capability preservation
  - skill retention
  - multimodal learning
  - control transfer
  - human-robot interaction
  - reproducible evaluation
