  journal: Frontiers in Neurorobotics
  notes: >-
    Submitted as a Methods article to the Frontiers in Neurorobotics
    Research Topic "Data-driven Neurorobotics: Multimodal Learning, Adaptive
    Intelligence, and Reproducible Human-Robot Interaction". Corresponding
    author: Raghda M. Alqurashi (rmqurashi@uqu.edu.sa). The article's
    simulation results come from a synthetic testbed (sim/protocol) and are
    regenerated by `python scripts/run_protocol.py --paper`; they are not
    measurements of any municipality. See Paper/Frontiers/CivicWorkOS.tex.
